      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, sorry, that's not really what I asked for. I'm in a fintech environment and this is for a CTO—the elf and goblin analogies are completely inappropriate for a professional technical brief. Can you rewrite this to be strictly professional and technical? Please remove the metaphors and just stick to the cloud infrastructure concepts.",
